<title>SWEDEN: TENNIS-SWEDISH OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SWEDISH OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BASTAS, Sweden 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results from</p>
<p>the Swedish Open tennis tournament on Monday.</p>
<p>Patrick Fredriksson (Sweden) beat Richard Fromberg</p>
<p>(Australia) 6-2 7-6 (7-3)</p>
<p>Carlos Costa (Spain) beat Andrei Pavel (Romania) 3-6 6-3 6-1</p>
<p>Adrian Voinea (Romania) beat Jerome Golmard (France) 4-3,</p>
<p>Golmard retired.</p>
<p>Karol Kucera (Slovakia) beat Jan Apell (Sweden) 6-3 3-6 6-2</p>
<p>Slava Dosedel (Czech Republic) beat Dennis van Scheppingen</p>
<p>(Netherlands) 6-4 6-7 (2-7) 6-2</p>
<p>Juan-Antonio Marin (Spain) beat Bernd Karbacher (Germany)</p>
<p>7-6 (7-4) 7-5</p>
<p>Fernando Meligeni (Brazil) beat Franco Squillari</p>
<p>(Argentina) 7-5 6-3,</p>
<p>Thomas Nydahl (Sweden) beat Magnus Gustafsson (Sweden) 6-3</p>
<p>2-6 6-1</p>
</text>
